[10.285695, "o", "revoked buddy 9Z+spWOZ (manifest=1 session=1)\r\nnote: the key is now on the revocation list, so a still-running buddy cannot\r\n      re-pair itself back in; it stops on its next round. A running daemon also\r\n      applies this on SIGHUP (kill -HUP <pid>) or restart, and an already-\r\n      established direct tunnel persists until it drops (see --reauth-interval).\r\n      To allow this buddy again later: peers allow <key>, then a NEW invite.\r\n"]
